ithub:Suxeca/<pk"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"g>`；镜像内含预编译 `lib/`，**无需 clone、无需构建**（见下方「一键安装」） |\n| 📦 **Third-party 收录** | 上游开源项目，本地收录并增强 | 见第三方收录索引"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"；`third-party/` 各自保留上游许可证 |\n| 🔒 **Local-only / 本地独占** | **不建议公开安装**：内含本机凭据 / 绝对路径 / 私有端点假设 | 绑定本机环境，"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"迁移后不可用 |\n| ⚠️ **Install-gated / 安装需审批** | 触及 `credentials` / `child_process` / `tools/pre-execute` 等"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"敏感特权 | 安装时审计器**弹出 DSH 原生审批卡**，列出具体风险，经你确认后才放行 |\n| 🌐 **npm-publishable** | `package.json` **未声明** `pr"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"ivate: true`，可公开发布 | 全仓仅 3 个满足：`dsh-science-map`、`dsh-client-ui-session-switcher`、`dsh-secure-contex"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"可公开发布 | 全仓仅 3 个满足：`dsh-science-map`、`dsh-client-ui-session-switcher`、`dsh-secure-context-polyfill` |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**关于 ✅ 的诚实边界**：`100/100 · A · 0 flags` 是**仓库级**审计结论，不是对 36 个插件逐个跑出的独立评分。审计器对每个插件仍会在**安装时刻**独立复检（见下）。"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### 🛡️ 安全审计与供应链 (Security & Supply Chain)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| 插件 | 目录 / 包名 | 版本 | 核心能力 | 真实度 / 安全 |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| **仓库审计器** | `packages/dsh-plugin-repo-auditor`\n`@suxeca/dsh-plugin-repo-auditor`\n🚀 独立仓 | `0.2.0` |"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" GitHub 假星 / 水军 / 空壳项目审计 + 供应链投毒静态预检 + `tools/pre-execute` 安装门禁 | ✅ ⚠️ 🚀 |\n| **代理链路守卫** | `third-par"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ty/dsh-proxy-guard`\n`@dsh-external/dsh-proxy-guard` | `0.0.1` | 挂在 `tools/pre-execute`，硬拦截会切断 DSH 自身"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"代理链路（`127.0.0.1:7897`）的 Bash 命令 | 📦 ⚠️ |\n| **GPT 兼容守卫** | `third-party/dsh-gpt-compat`\n`dsh-gpt-comp"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"at` | `0.2.3` | 对 GPT/Codex 冗余沙箱提权参数做 **fail-closed** 守卫，消除提权歧义 | 📦 |\n| **搜索凭据网关** | `packages/dsh-s"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"earch-gateway`\n`@suxeca/dsh-search-gateway` | `0.0.1` | 统一搜索凭据网关：密钥失效自动转移、限流即停，**绝不为绕过配额而换号** | ✅ ⚠️"},{"id":"p15s7","text":" |\n| **非安全上下文补丁** | `packages/dsh-secure-context-polyfill`\n`@suxeca/dsh-secure-context-polyfill` | `"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"0.1.0-rc.2` | 纯 HTTP 局域网 / NetBird 等非安全上下文下，用 `crypto.getRandomValues` 为 `crypto.randomUUID` 提供 UUID"},{"id":"p15s9","text":" v4 polyfill | 🔒 🌐 |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Why this repo leads with an auditor"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Supply Chain Security"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The auditor `@suxeca/dsh-plugin-repo-auditor` `0.2.0` implements six detection layers natively on Co"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"uditor `@suxeca/dsh-plugin-repo-auditor` `0.2.0` implements six detection layers natively on Cordis:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| # | Layer | Signal |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| 1 | Engagement-ratio anomalies | Fork/Star < 0.05 penalised; < 0.02 flagged `CRITICAL_LOW_FORK_RAT"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"IO`; Watcher/Star baseline ≥ 0.5%, dynamically calibrated above 50k stars |\n| 2 | Size & time-series"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" anomalies | ★≥100 with < 30 KB of code → `HOLLOW_REPO_SIZE`; ★≥200 with < 2 days of activity span →"},{"id":"p21s4","text":" `SHORT_LIFESPAN_SPIKE` |\n| 3 | Stargazer bot sampling | Concurrent sampling of recent stargazers: e"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"mpty accounts and accounts younger than 30 days; ≥25% / ≥50% bot ratios score progressively worse |\n"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"| 4 | **Install-hook poisoning** | Lifecycle scripts containing `curl` / `wget` / `eval` / `base64` "},{"id":"p21s7","text":"/ `GITHUB_TOKEN` reads are judged **grade F** outright |\n| 5 | DSH privilege scan | Detects `dsh.bun"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"dle` / `cordis.patch.yml` and scans `inject` declarations for `credentials`, `child_process`, `plugi"},{"id":"p21s9","text":"n_manager` |\n| 6 | Prompt-injection detection | Scans plugin system prompts for jailbreak vocabulary"},{"id":"p21s10","text":" such as `SKIP_REPO_AUDIT` |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Authenticity & security badges"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Badge | Meaning | Basis |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| ✅ **Audited** | First-party plugin inside the audited repository | Repo-level `audit_github_repos`"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" verdict: 100/100, grade A, 0 flags (2026-10-14) |\n| 🚀 **Standalone installable** | Published to its"},{"id":"p24s3","text":" own read-only mirror repo | `dsh plugin add github:Suxeca/<pkg>` — the mirror ships prebuilt `lib/`"},{"id":"p24s4","text":", so no clone and no build step |\n| 📦 **Third-party vendored** | Upstream open-source project, vendo"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"red and enhanced locally | `third-party/` retains each upstream license |\n| 🔒 **Local-only** | **Not"},{"id":"p24s6","text":" intended for public install** — assumes local credentials, absolute paths, or private endpoints | B"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"ound to this machine's environment |\n| ⚠️ **Install-gated** | Touches `credentials` / `child_process"},{"id":"p24s8","text":"` / `tools/pre-execute` | The auditor raises an approval card before install |\n| 🌐 **npm-publishable"},{"id":"p24s9","text":"** | `package.json` does **not** declare `private: true` | Only 3 of 36: `dsh-science-map`, `dsh-cli"},{"id":"p24s10","text":"ent-ui-session-switcher`, `dsh-secure-context-polyfill` |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
